---
title: Moroccan Chicken and Chickpeas
source: claude
servings: 4
tags: [soup, freezer, instant-pot]
cook time: 10 minutes
---

> About 13 g fiber and 38 g protein per serving.

Put @chicken thigh{2%lb}, @chickpeas{30%oz}(drained), @diced tomatoes{14.5%oz}, @carrot{3}(chopped), @onion{1}(chopped), @garlic{3%cloves}(minced), @ground cumin{2%tsp}, @ground coriander{1%tsp}, @ground cinnamon{1%tsp} and @chicken broth{1%cup} in an #Instant Pot{}.

Seal and pressure cook for ~{10%minutes}, then let the pressure release naturally.

After reheating, stir in @spinach{1%bunch} until wilted.
